# fish configuration.
#
# Everything lives in conf.d/, sourced automatically in filename order BEFORE
# this file. Numbered so the order is explicit rather than accidental:
#
#   10-env         environment variables
#   15-brew        homebrew shellenv (before user paths, so ours win)
#   20-cachyos     distro defaults: aliases, greeting, MANPAGER, `done`
#   30-path        PATH assembly (fish_add_path, deduplicating)
#   40-aliases     dotfiles + figaro shortcuts
#   50-conda       lazy miniconda
#   60-prompt      starship + zoxide
#   65-figaro-prompt   $FIGARO_PROMPT for starship's [custom.figaro]
#   70-fzf         fzf.fish key bindings
#
#   fish_frozen_theme / fish_frozen_key_bindings   written by fish itself (4.3
#   migration). Edit the theme there or via `fish_config`.
#
# Nothing else belongs in this file. Add a new numbered module instead.
